fhmm-fortran is a modern Fortran translation of the numerical algorithms in
fHMM 1.4.3.

Upstream package:
  fHMM: Fitting Hidden Markov Models to Financial Data
  Authors: Lennart Oelschlaeger, Timo Adam, and Rouven Michels
  License: GNU General Public License version 3

This translation is a modified work. It is not an official release of the
upstream authors. The complete supplied upstream source is retained under
original/fHMM-1.4.3 and the uploaded archive is retained under provenance.
